---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const validator = {
  name: 'ALESSIO',
  address: 'GaK38GT7LmgCpRSTRdDC2LeiMaV9TJmx8NmQcb9L3cJ3fyX',
  commission: '15%',
  location: 'Self-hosted, Switzerland',
  assetHubSubscan: 'https://assethub-kusama.subscan.io/validator/GaK38GT7LmgCpRSTRdDC2LeiMaV9TJmx8NmQcb9L3cJ3fyX',
};
---
<Base title="Kusama — ironoa" description="ironoa Kusama validator details and specifications.">
  <h1 class="h1"><img src="/kusama-icon.jpg" alt="Kusama" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 0.5rem;" /> Kusama Validator</h1>
  <p>Independent Kusama validator, self-hosted in Southern Switzerland.</p>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-fingerprint"></i> Validator Details</h2>
    <ul class="kv">
      <li><span>Validator</span><code>{validator.name}</code></li>
      <li><span>Address</span><code style="font-size: 0.8rem;">{validator.address}</code></li>
      <li><span>Commission</span><code>{validator.commission}</code></li>
      <li><span>Hosting</span><code>{validator.location}</code></li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:.75rem; display:flex; gap:.75rem; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a class="btn" href={validator.assetHubSubscan} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><i class="mdi mdi-open-in-new"></i> AssetHub Subscan</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://telemetry.polkadot.io/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><i class="mdi mdi-open-in-new"></i> Telemetry</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-server"></i> Infrastructure</h2>
    <p>Self-hosted on owned hardware in Southern Switzerland, moved there from a rented datacenter in September 2026. The trade is deliberate: one less intermediary between the operator and the machine, and one more validator outside the handful of providers that host most of the network.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 1rem;">Hardware Specifications</h3>
    <ul class="kv">
      <li><span>CPU</span><code>AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D</code></li>
      <li><span>Cores</span><code>8 dedicated cores, no SMT siblings</code></li>
      <li><span>Memory</span><code>24GB ECC DDR5</code></li>
      <li><span>Storage</span><code>4TB NVMe SSD, dedicated</code></li>
      <li><span>Network</span><code>10 Gbit/s symmetric, unmetered</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Monitoring</h3>
    <p>Dedicated external monitoring system with 24/7 alerting ensures operational continuity.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-information-outline"></i> Independent Operation</h2>
    <p>This validator operates fully independently, relying on direct nominations from the community. The validator initially participated in the 1KV Program but now runs autonomously following the program's shutdown.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2 class="h2"><i class="mdi mdi-anchor"></i> How to Nominate</h2>
    <ol style="margin-left:1.25rem; line-height: 1.8;">
      <li>Open the Kusama Asset Hub <a href="https://polkadot.js.org/apps/?rpc=wss%3A%2F%2Fkusama-asset-hub-rpc.polkadot.io#/staking" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" style="text-decoration: underline;">Polkadot.js Staking interface</a></li>
      <li>Select your stash account and choose "Nominate"</li>
      <li>Add our validator address: <code style="font-size: 0.75rem;">{validator.address}</code></li>
      <li>Confirm the transaction</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</Base>
